cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OpenResearchMetrics, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OpenResearchMetrics: transparent open science indicators for responsible research assessment"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-02
authors:
  - family-names: "Sánchez-Núñez"
    given-names: "Pablo"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7845-9506"
url: "https://pablosancheznunez.github.io/openresearchmetrics/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pablosancheznunez/openresearchmetrics"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - open science
  - responsible research assessment
  - DORA
  - CoARA
  - research indicators
  - metaresearch
abstract: >-
  A versioned catalog of open science indicators (availability, accessibility,
  reuse, declared reproducibility and methodological transparency) and a
  dependency-free engine and web tool that compute them from OpenAlex,
  DataCite and the OpenAIRE Graph. Each indicator is reported on its own with
  its evidence and limitations; there is no composite score.
